      <div class="tour-body"><div class="tour-duration">Multiple Itineraries</div><h3>Hunan Discovery Tours</h3><p>Explore Zhangjiajie's floating peaks alongside Fenghuang Ancient Town — one of China's most beautiful riverside villages — and the spicy culinary capital of Changsha. Multiple itineraries from 4 to 8 days.</p><a href="/hunan-tours.html" class="btn btn-outline">View Tours</a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="tour-card reveal">
      <div class="tour-image"><img loading="lazy" src="/assets/images/hero-silkroad.jpg" alt="Private Zhangjiajie Tour" width="1200" height="800"></div>
      <div class="tour-body"><div class="tour-duration">Customizable</div><h3>Private Zhangjiajie Adventure</h3><p>Custom itinerary with your own guide — sunrise at the Grand Viewing Platform, skip-the-line Glass Bridge, Tianmen Mountain sunrise hike, Tujia village homestay, and a sunset cable car descent over the 99 bends.</p><a href="/contact.html" class="btn btn-outline">Plan My Trip</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

